OL,3,GNEWSA'We'll dust ourselves down' after
OL,4,Aculture snub
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP said missing out on UK City of
OL,7,FCulture 2029 was disappointing but the
OL,8,Ftown just had to "dust" itself down and
OL,9,Fwas still a "cultural powerhouse".
OL,11,FMiddlesbrough was on a nine-strong
OL,12,Flonglist, but failed to make the
OL,13,Fshortlist which would have unlocked
OL,14,Ffurther funding and put them in line
OL,15,Ffor a #10m prize.
OL,17,FLabour MP Andy McDonald said the area's
OL,18,Fbid for City of Culture had been "bold
OL,19,Fand compelling".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
