OL,3,GNEWSA'We'll dust ourselves down' after
OL,4,Aculture snub
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe four places still in the running
OL,7,Finclude Blackpool, Milton Keynes,
OL,8,FSheffield and Wrexham - with the winner
OL,9,Fset to be announced in early 2027.
